sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as OutboxWorker
  participant P as persistence
  participant E as EnviarDocumento / ConsultarEstado
  participant S as SUNAT

  loop cada 10 s
    W->>P: SELECT outbox WHERE siguiente_intento <= now AND locked_until IS NULL FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED LIMIT 50
    W->>P: locked_until = now + 2 min
    W->>E: ejecutar(accion, agregadoId)
    E->>S: sendBill / getStatus / GET envios
    alt éxito
      E->>P: actualizar estado · DELETE outbox
    else fallo transitorio
      E->>P: intentos+1 · siguiente_intento = now + min(2^intentos min, 6 h) · unlock
    else intentos > máx (configurable, 20)
      E->>P: estado ERROR_ENVIO definitivo · DELETE outbox · evento
    end
  end
